      "title": "Two MarginOptions types",
      "items": [
        "DKNet.Svc.PdfGenerators.Options.MarginOptions (this page) holds CSS strings.",
        "PuppeteerSharp.Media.MarginOptions is what Chromium actually receives.",
        "Importing both namespaces makes the bare name ambiguous (CS0104)."
      ]
